<title>USA: Louisville feeder cattle prices steady-firm - USDA.</title>
<headline>Louisville feeder cattle prices steady-firm - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>LOUISVILLE 1997-05-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Feeder steers and heifers were steady to firm, compared to last week's close, USDA said.</p>
<p>Feeder Steers - Medium and Large 1 600- 700 lbs</p>
<p>75.50-80.50; 700-800 lbs 72.00-77.00. Small 1 300-400 lbs</p>
<p>71.00-81.00. Hodlsteins - Large 2 900-1000 lbs 53.50-57.00.</p>
<p>Feeder Heifers - Medium and Large 1 600-700 lbs</p>
<p>66.50-74.50 and package blacks 609 lbs 77.00; 700-800 lbs</p>
<p>62.00-70.50. Medium and Large 2 500-600 lbs 61.50-71.75.</p>
<p>Cattle and Calves Receipts - 1,800</p>
<p>((Chicago newsdesk 312-408-8720))</p>
</text>
